    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good points. i also want to be prepared for when they try to argue that the regulations are \"essential\" for the environment or whatever. can you give me some counter-points to those kinds of arguments? like, how can i show that those environmental justifications don't really outweigh the economic damage they're causing?",
